<title>USA: Community First completes Wyoming deal.</title>
<headline>Community First completes Wyoming deal.</headline>
<dateline>FARGO, N.D. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community First Bankshares Inc said Monday it has completed the $135 million acquisition of KeyBank National Association in Wyoming from KeyCorp.</p>
<p>The cash payment was a $60 million premium over the bank's remaining $75 million in equity after a special dividend to KeyCorp, Community First said.</p>
<p>KeyBank National serves 24 Wyoming markets and has deposits of $950 million and total assets of $1.1 billion, Community First said.</p>
<p>Community First shares were up 1/2 at 38-3/8 Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
